    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n269" root="اجر" body-key="A">
    
      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آجر</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُؤَاجَرَةٌ</span>: see 1, latter half, in
three places: and see 10. One says also, of a
woman, (K,) or a whorish female slave, (TA,)
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آجَرَتْ</span>, [of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَاعَلَتْ</span>, not <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَفْعَلَتْ</span>, (see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُؤْجِرٌ</span>,
below,)] meaning <i>She prostituted herself for hire.</i>
(K.)

